    <description>Flow updates MA Fields from related Account,  Manage Default Consultant for MA and Creates &apos;MA Competitor&apos; Record.

1) When a new record is created, calls a Flow ‘MACM VP/VPCR-RVP/SCE/SCE Player-CoachUpdateifStatusisOpen 2’ which will eventually update the new MA record with values from associated Account. 
2) Creates &apos;MA Competitors&apos; record for National Accounts.
3) Associate or Delete &quot;UHC - Direct, No Consultant&quot; based on the value of Does this Oppty\Risk Involve Consultant. the &quot;UHC - Direct, No Consultant&quot; Consultant.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>IsCreatedbyQA</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>AND(ISNEW(),{!$Record.Is_Created_by_QA__c} = false)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>isNewMAConsultantNo</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>AND(ISNEW(),ISPICKVAL({!$Record.Does_this_Oppty_Risk_Involve_Consultant__c} , &apos;No&apos;) )</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>oldvalue</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>PRIORVALUE({!$Record.Does_this_Oppty_Risk_Involve_Consultant__c} )</expression>
    </formulas>
